{"id":73680,"date":"2026-11-10T19:23:30","date_gmt":"2026-11-10T19:23:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73680"},"modified":"2026-11-10T20:28:02","modified_gmt":"2026-11-10T19:28:02","slug":"trail-dos-reis","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-reis\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail dos Reis &#8211; Baltar, Paredes 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail dos Reis - Baltar, Paredes 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail dos Reis - Baltar, Paredes 2027<\/strong> (IV edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, dia <strong>10 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no quartel dos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Baltar<\/strong> (Avenida dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios, n\u00ba 1443), na freguesia de <strong>Baltar<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Paredes<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. O secretariado abre \u00e0s <strong>07:30<\/strong> para levantamento de dorsais e as partidas decorrem de forma escalonada \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> (Trail Longo), <strong>08:45<\/strong> (Trail Curto) e <strong>09:00<\/strong> (Caminhada).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A prova integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias desenhadas nos trilhos e caminhos serranos envolventes de Baltar: o <strong>Trail Longo de 25 km<\/strong> (reservado a maiores de 18 anos), o <strong>Trail Curto de 15 km<\/strong> (aberto a maiores de 16 anos) e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> de \u00edndole n\u00e3o competitiva. O evento estabelece um tempo limite global de <strong>4 horas<\/strong>, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio o porte de telem\u00f3vel operacional e apelando-se \u00e0 utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o de copo pr\u00f3prio nos postos de abastecimento por responsabilidade ambiental.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Baltar<\/strong> segundo o regulamento-tipo da ATRP, o evento inclui no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o um kit completo (mochila saco, dorsal e t-shirt t\u00e9cnica), seguro desportivo, refor\u00e7os durante o percurso, servi\u00e7o de duche nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Escola Secund\u00e1ria de Baltar e <strong>almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio<\/strong> no final da manh\u00e3, culminando na entrega de pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00e3o (Geral, Sub-29, 30\u201339, 40\u201349, 50\u201359 e +60 M\/F) e pr\u00e9mio \u00e0 equipa mais numerosa pelas 12:00. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Baltar, Paredes, Porto<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; le