#34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica (1\u00aa a 3\u00aa Fase):<\/strong> 10,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail dos Reis - Baltar, Paredes 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O IV Trail dos Reis realiza-se no domingo, dia 10 de janeiro de 2027, com secretariado, partidas e chegadas no quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Baltar (Avenida dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios, n\u00ba 1443, 4585-015 Baltar, Paredes).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:30 no quartel. O Trail Longo (cerca de 25 km, maiores de 18 anos) parte \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Curto (cerca de 15 km, maiores de 16 anos) parte \u00e0s 08:45 e a Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva (cerca de 10 km) parte \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail dos Reis 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abrem a 15 de novembro de 2026 e encerram a 3 de janeiro de 2027: na 1\u00aa Fase (15\/11) custam 15,00\u20ac (Trail Longo), 12,00\u20ac (Trail Curto) e 10,00\u20ac (Caminhada); na 2\u00aa Fase (16\/11 a 20\/12) passam a 18,00\u20ac, 15,00\u20ac e 10,00\u20ac; e na 3\u00aa Fase (21\/12 a 03\/01\/2027) fixam-se em 20,00\u20ac, 17,00\u20ac e 10,00\u20ac, online ou presencialmente na Central de Comunica\u00e7\u00f5es dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Baltar.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e onde s\u00e3o os banhos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem kit de participante (mochila saco, dorsal e t-shirt), seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos durante o percurso, servi\u00e7o de duche nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Escola Secund\u00e1ria de Baltar e almo\u00e7o no final da prova.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite global para concluir o IV Trail dos Reis \u00e9 de 4 horas. Nos percursos de Trail \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar telem\u00f3vel totalmente operacional, sendo apelado o transporte de copo pr\u00f3prio para os abastecimentos e recomendado o uso de corta-vento, chap\u00e9u ou gorro.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e que escal\u00f5es t\u00eam direito a pr\u00e9mio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Baltar. S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios pelas 12:00 aos 3 primeiros classificados M\/F da Geral e dos escal\u00f5es Sub-29, 30\u201339, 40\u201349, 50\u201359 e +60 anos tanto no Trail Longo como no Trail Curto, al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mio para a equipa mais numerosa.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail dos Reis - Baltar, Paredes 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-10\", \